ms/v1/","context":{"app_id":4927030,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4927030-1847286114040447","game_id":"steam-4927030","kind":"update","title":"Last Buzz Update 0.6.2 — Zero-G Chaos & The Wang Horn!","summary":"Last Buzz Update 0.6.2 — Zero-G Chaos & The Wang Horn!Things are about to get louder—and considerably less affected by gravity.Update 0.6.2 introduces two new items, a first look at the Fly inventory system, expanded movement mechanics, major wall-crawling improvements, and a large collection of multiplayer, weapon, physics, and door fixes.New Hunter Item: Zero-G Trap 🌀Hunters can now purchase and deploy the new Zero-G Trap.Once initialized, its animated eye begins searching for nearby Flies. Wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T18:55:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040447","verified_at":"2026-10-24T23:50:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927030-1846651706692278","game_id":"steam-4927030","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest: Smash, Slide & Explore Sunny House!","summary":"We’re Part of Steam Next Fest! 🎉Last Buzz is participating in Steam Next Fest!Playing the game during this special week directly supports our team and helps more players discover the game. Jump into Sunny House, invite your friends, try the new mechanics, and share your experience with us!Every match makes a difference—thank you for supporting Last Buzz during Steam Next Fest!P.S. We’re continuously improving and balancing the game for our players. The more you play and share your feedback, the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:59:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692278","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927030-1846018067939969","game_id":"steam-4927030","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.5.7 — Halloween Surprises, Performance Improvements & Gameplay Fixes","summary":"Update 0.5.7 — Halloween Surprises, Performance Improvements & Gameplay FixesFirst of all, a massive thank you to everyone playing our demo, reporting bugs, sharing videos, and sending feedback. You’re awesome!Update 0.5.7 brings performance improvements, smoother Fly movement, more reliable interactions, and fixes for several frustrating issues reported by the community. We’ve also prepared a Halloween surprise for both Humans and Flies! 🎃Halloween EventHalloween accessories: Interact with the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T04:36:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939969","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927030-1844115010496570","game_id":"steam-4927030","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.4.4 — New Modes, Fairer Matches & Smoother Multiplayer","summary":"First of all, a massive thank you to everyone who played our demo—YOU ARE AWESOME!Over the past two sleepless weeks, we’ve been closely monitoring match data: who wins, who loses, what weapons are bought, and how traps are used. That is a ton of information, and we immediately rolled up our sleeves to fix bugs, rebalance unfair mechanics, polish visuals, and improve connection quality. We’ve accomplished a ton of work, and we’re just getting started.Balancing Note: Game balance adjustments are b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T04:01:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496570","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927030-1842846814447647","game_id":"steam-4927030","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Desync Fixes & Multiplayer Improvements","summary":"Hello everyone,First off, a massive thank you to everyone who has jumped into the demo, played some matches, and shared your feedback with us. Seeing people finally play Last Buzz has been incredible, and your reports are directly helping us decide what to tackle next.Our team is currently heads-down working on the next update, with a heavy focus on multiplayer stability, performance, and bug fixes.Currently in Development:Major Desync Fix: We’ve identified a serious multiplayer desync issue tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T19:44:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447647","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927030-1842212951311796","game_id":"steam-4927030","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Sneak Peek: We Added Magic Mushrooms 🍄","summary":"Hey everyone!While the demo is making its way through the review process, we’ve been busy working on more stuff for the full Early Access release.And, well...We added mushrooms. 🍄Not normal mushrooms, obviously.These things are scattered around the map, and when you find one, you have two very sensible options:🍄 Eat itYep. Just eat the suspicious glowing mushroom you found on the floor.It can give you buffs, mutations, weird effects... or potentially make your situation a whole lot worse.We’re s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T00:26:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/